 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 602T119 569T109 550Q109 549 114 549Q132 549 151 535T170 489Q170 464 154 447T109 429Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E13-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-37\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"722\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-35\" x=\"1723\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"2501\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(3558,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-32\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span> Therefore, if we would like to have a triangle, <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"3.713ex\" height=\"3.009ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1150.1 1598.8 1295.7\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-14-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-14-Title\">\\overline{BC}</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E14-MJMATHI-42\" d=\"M231 637Q204 637 199 638T194 649Q194 676 205 682Q206 683 335 683Q594 683 608 681Q671 671 713 636T756 544Q756 480 698 429T565 360L555 357Q619 348 660 311T702 219Q702 146 630 78T453 1Q446 0 242 0Q42 0 39 2Q35 5 35 10Q35 17 37 24Q42 43 47 45Q51 46 62 46H68Q95 46 128 49Q142 52 147 61Q150 65 219 339T288 628Q288 635 231 637ZM649 544Q649 574 634 600T585 634Q578 636 493 637Q473 637 451 637T416 636H403Q388 635 384 626Q382 622 352 506Q352 503 351 500L320 374H401Q482 374 494 376Q554 386 601 434T649 544ZM595 229Q595 273 572 302T512 336Q506 337 429 337Q311 337 310 336Q310 334 293 263T258 122L240 52Q240 48 252 48T333 46Q422 46 429 47Q491 54 543 105T595 229Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E14-MJMATHI-43\" d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E14-MJMAIN-AF\" d=\"M69 544V590H430V544H69Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<g transform=\"translate(24,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMATHI-42\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMATHI-43\" x=\"759\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(29,522)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMAIN-AF\" x=\"-70\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(60.921811645905365,0) scale(3.9545834205182944,1)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMAIN-AF\"></use>\n</g>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMAIN-AF\" x=\"1719\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span> must be longer than the difference of the other sides: \n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"17.237ex\" height=\"9.843ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -4.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -2370 7421.5 4237.8\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-15-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-15-Title\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"2\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"